DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T000000
UID:261027d2D_3_lMQkCSMsK34OX5DQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Isis Oasis Sanctuary in Geyserville\, California fo
 r a special evening of exploring the fascinating and allegedly haunted gro
 unds of Isis Oasis Sanctuary. You'll hear some of the amazing history of t
 his place and visit locations where residents and guests alike have report
 ed unusual activity\, plus a rare visit to our little-known Egyptian Tomb 
 Room. Author deTraci Regula guides you on this tour which lasts approximat
 ely one hour. Bring a flashlight and be prepared to walk over some uneven 
 ground and go up and down stairs. \\(Alternative accessible tour available
  on request.\\)
LOCATION:Isis Oasis Sanctuary
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/geyserville-ghost-egyptian-tomb-room-tour
 -at-isis-oasis-tickets-2003934279374
