BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/screams-anniversary-at-sonoma-community-center/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/screams-anniversary-at-sonoma-community-center/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/screams-anniversary-at-sonoma-community-center/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Scream's Anniversary at Sonoma Community Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T000000
UID:261020sNQUU8sdN0yXXOG9MKB9uA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the  30th Anniversary of Scream with a one-of-a-kind
  overnight event at Sonoma Community Center\, the real-life filming locati
 on of Woodsboro High School. Fans will enjoy a screening of the iconic hor
 ror film\, exclusive after-hours access to the historic building\, themed 
 activities\, photo opportunities\, midnight snacks\, and a paranormal pres
 entation. Guests can explore the halls featured in the movie\, connect wit
 h fellow fans\, and take part in interactive experiences throughout the ni
 ght. The event also includes food\, drinks\, commemorative swag\, and a sp
 ecial breakfast before departure. With attendance limited to a small group
 \, this immersive experience offers horror fans a rare chance to step into
  the world of Scream and relive movie history at the location where it all
  began.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/screams-anniversary-at-sonoma-community-c
 enter/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
