DESCRIPTION:Its that spooky time of year again\, but now we get to do the s
 pooking\, The Rodney Strong workers are doing a Halloween Picket in downtow
 n Healdsburg to spook the Rodney Strong bosses. They will have bandas (musi
 cians)\, candy\, and everyone is encouraged to dress up like its Halloween 
 for this family friendly event. Come join us in supporting hard working mem
 bers of our community in fighting for their right for a fair contract!\nRod
 ney Strong workers have been in the process of unionization and the owners 
 are being uncooperative\, even going so far as to hire a MAGA union-buster.
  Let's get out there and show them worker solidarity!\n\nRSVP: https://soli
 darity.socodsa.org/rodney-strong-picketing
