DESCRIPTION:Help Cure Absentee Ballots! Over 13\,000 voters have already v
 oted by mail this year in North Carolina! Join us to help make sure our vo
 tes are heard. We will be calling voters who’ve already voted by mail bu
 t whose ballots have been rejected\, who need to take a few extra steps to
  cure their ballot. All you need is a phone and a laptop to attend. At the
  start of the phonebank we’ll provide you with our training\, script\, a
 nd our support to help you make an impact on voters!
