  Yard by Oxbow. Retro grooves\, dance-floor favorites and today's hits in 
 the open air\, from 3 to 6 PM.\n\nThe Halloween Extravaganza benefits the 
 Napa Valley Education Foundation. Tickets: $20 adults\, $10 youth.\n\nCost
 umes welcome. Grab a drink\, find a spot in the yard\, and stay for the wh
 ole set.\n\nBe kind to everyone… including yourself.
