DESCRIPTION:🎃✨ HALLOWEEN GLOW FLOW – SATURDAY\, 10/31! ✨🎃 Brea
 k out your NEONS\, put on your best Halloween costume\, and get ready to G
 LOW! We're bringing some extra fun to the mat with 3 Halloween Glow Flow c
 lasses throughout the day! 👻 Dress up\, show off your creativity\, and 
 get into the Halloween spirit. The best costume in EACH class wins a prize
 ! 🏆 Grab your friends\, pick your favorite class\, and join us for a li
 ttle spooky fun with your YogaSix community. Come ready to move\, sweat\, 
