DESCRIPTION:**Date:** Saturday\, October 31\, 2026\n\n**Time:** Doors 6 P
 M | Show 7:30 PM\n\n**Tickets:** $10 | Free for Coyote Sonoma Club Member
 s\n\nSince 1992\, The Remedies have been casting their spell over Sonoma\,
  Marin\, and Napa with a potent potion of Classic Rock\, Blues\, and R&B. 
 Founded by Steve Pabros and Clark Mason\, this Sonoma-based high-energy da
 nce band has been raising spirits and keeping dance floors alive for decad
 es.\n\nOn this haunted night\, The Remedies will bring the same electrifyi
 ng energy and timeless hits that have delighted thousands of fans--only wi
 th a Halloween twist. Expect a thrilling set that will make you move\, gro
 ove\, and maybe even howl at the moon. Don your costumes\, grab your crew\
 , and let The Remedies be your cure for a frighteningly fun night of music
  and dancing!
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
