X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Day of the Dead with the Herd: Ancestors\, Horses & the Healing of
  Grief
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T153000
UID:2610109Lix2I4VT02NmCOTmMDF8w
DESCRIPTION:Day of the Dead with the Herd: Ancestors\, Horses & the Healin
 g of Grief\n\nJoin Alane Freund\, LMFT\, and the Heart & Mind Equine herd 
 for an intimate daylong retreat honoring our ancestors\, remembering loved
  ones\, and exploring grief and healing. Inspired by Día de los Muertos a
 nd seasonal traditions of remembrance\, this unique experience combines eq
 uine-assisted therapy\, somatic practices\, sound healing\, and ritual. Pa
 rticipants are invited to bring a meaningful object for a communal ancesto
 r altar. No horse experience necessary. Lunch and refreshments included. L
 imited to 15 participants.\n\nSunday\, November 1 | 9:30 AM–3:30 PM Wood
 acre\, CA\n\nRegistration: https://www.heartmindequine.com/day-of-the-dead
LOCATION:Heart and Mind Equine
URL:https://www.heartmindequine.com/day-of-the-dead
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
