 day Doll Show! Hosted annually by the Redwood Empire Doll and Study Club\,
  a United Federation of Doll Clubs non-profit 501\\(c\\) \\(3\\) Chapter. 
 It’s an opportunity to connect with doll and toy collectors and creators
  from near and far. Over 85 tables of dealers selling antique\, vintage\, 
 miniature\, artist\, modern dolls and toys which creates an environment fo
 r learning\, celebrating\, and treasure hunting! A Fashion Doll Reclamatio
 n Workshop \\(not included in admission\\) for ages 7\\+ is happening duri
