DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T180000
UID:261031e0RMEYrlL0axmezwJ3ZzPQ
DESCRIPTION:Learn the art of singing from two exceptional musicians\, voca
 lists\, and teachers at this one-day workshop on November 1\, from 11am-6p
 m at the Art and Music Gallery\, 824 Petaluma Blvd. South. A light lunch i
 s included.\n\nThis workshop will take your singing to a new level\, focus
 ing on the beautiful vocals in acoustic bluegrass music. Keith Little has 
 more than 50 years of experience in the worldwide acoustic music scene. He
 len Foley has more than 15 years performing nationally and internationally
  with award-winning musicians. She has a particular love for bluegrass har
 mony singing. Keith has been hosting his Singing Arts workshop in the Bay 
 area since 2006. Both are members of the California Bluegrass Association.
  For more information and registration details\, email Betty Bugaj at bkbu
 gaj@icloud.com.
LOCATION:Art and Music Gallery
URL:https://artandmusicgallery.com/upcoming-events/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
