UID:261031JrXeHOeEz0m91BcBPRp20w
DESCRIPTION:Dear friends\,\n\nOur last opportunity to see each other in 20
 26 is approaching on Sunday November 1st at 4 to 6 pm. You’re warmly inv
 ited to chant with us\, or simply listen and receive.\n\nWe are getting to
 gether to build an altar and sing to honor our loved ones.\n\nBecause spac
 e is limited\, please reserve your spot here: LINK to RSVP in advance if y
 ou plan to attend.\n\nHope to see you next week on Sunday November 1st at 
 Cotati Wellness\,  a beautiful space led by Kali Ma\, 8274 Old Redwood Hig
 hway\, Cotati\, CA 94931.\n\nIf you’re longing for a quiet\, nourishing
  way to reconnect with yourself\, with community\, and with sound\, we wou
 ld love to share this space with you.\n\nWith love\, Juan and JanineSevam
 antra 💛
LOCATION:Cotati Wellness Center
