 lect your preferred dates from the dropdown.*\n\n*Note: each date must be 
 added individually. Please select dates one at a time\, clicking “add to
  cart” after each selection.*\n\nTuesday\, November 3rd\, 2026 - 1-4pm 
 \n\nSaturday\, November 14th\, 2026 - 9am-12pm \n\nThursday\, December 10
 th\, 2026- 5:30-8:30pm \n\nSaturday\, December 19th\, 2026 - 1-4pm \n\nT
 hursday\, January 7th\, 2027 - 1-4pm \n\nSaturday\, January 23rd\, 2027 -
  12-3pm\n\n$68.00 Attendance Price + $30.00 Materials = $98.00 Registratio
 n\n\n***Register for 3 sessions\, and receive 10% off!***\n\n***Please rea
 ch out to cmarshall@sebarts.org for discount code.***\n\n**Class Descripti
 on:**\n\nCelebrate the beauty of each season with flowers! In every class\
 , create a different arrangement using seasonal blooms and colors. Enjoy s
 tep-by-step guidance\, learn floral design techniques\, and connect with n
 ew friends. Leave with a beautiful arrangement you made yourself. No exper
 ience needed!\n\nFlowers\, Greenery\, and Vase included.\n\nRefreshments p
 rovided.\n\nLimited space!
