SUMMARY:Cara Markovich is November's Featured Artist at Sky Ranch Gallery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T150000
UID:261019HsfTI-BoO069fBz1q2wNxQ
DESCRIPTION:Cara Mia Markovich’s art is an ongoing exploration of the re
 lationship between observation\, imagination\, and the natural world.\n\nW
 hether painting outdoors\, working from a still life\, or building a compo
 sition with foraged botanicals\, she seeks to celebrate nature’s beauty 
 through color\, texture\, and a playful\,\n\nimpressionistic spirit.
LOCATION:Sky Ranch Gallery
URL:https://www.skyranchgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
