X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Cool Petaluma's 5th Annual Shindig: the Launch Party for Cool Futu
 re
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T193000
UID:261027mESOuqXsLkSEIB9DiIuPig
DESCRIPTION:Join Cool Petaluma for our 5th annual Shindig\, a community mi
 xer and fundraiser at the beautiful Hall of the Above!\n\nThis year\, we
 ’re celebrating something big: the launch of our new nonprofit\, Cool Fu
 ture. With your support\, Cool Future will bring Cool Petaluma’s neighbo
 r-to-neighbor climate resilience program\, Cool Teams\, to 4 more Northern
  CA cities in 2027. This grassroots movement started right here in Petalum
 a. Our ongoing neighborhood connection work in town⏤and our chance to sh
 are what we’ve learned⏤are made possible entirely by community members
  like you.\n\nEnjoy tasty bites\, local libations\, and a stellar silent a
 uction while you meet like-minded neighbors and catch up with old friends.
  Tickets start at $50. Event sponsorships are also available.\n\nEvery tic
 ket sold helps keep this community-funded program growing!
LOCATION:Hall of the Above
URL:https://www.coolfuture.earth/events/shindig-2026
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
