SUMMARY:Beginning Yang-Style Tai Chi
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T183000
UID:tribe-10005143@sonomacommunitycenter.org
DESCRIPTION:About the ClassDiscover the gentle\, flowing movements of Mast
 er Choy’s Yang Family Tai Chi sequence in this calm and restorative prac
 tice. Through meditative movement\, you’ll improve balance and stability
 \, reduce stress and cultivate inner calm\, strengthen body awareness\, an
 d restore vital energy. This accessible class supports overall wellness an
 d helps you cultivate harmony of mind\, body\, and spirit. All levels welc
 ome\, including beginners seeking a peaceful introduction to this ancient 
 practi
