BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/cuban-salsa/", "Press Democrat": "https://salsadancemarin.com/cuban-salsa/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/cuban-salsa/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Cuban Salsa Beginner - 4-Week Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T203000
UID:261003iWcPMQGNqUKgLYKCLZjCKQ
DESCRIPTION:Cuban Salsa Class with Eric Celestino & Abigail Celestino\n\n4
 week class\n\nNovember 5- November 26\n\nClass requires a minimum of 8 reg
 istrations to run. Please register soon so we can secure the session!\n\nT
 his is a beginner cuban salsa—you will learn your basic footwork and tur
 ns.\n\nIn this class\, you will learn the fundamentals of Cuban Salsa\, in
 cluding body movement\, rhythm\, musicality\, footwork\, partner connectio
 n\, and partnerwork patterns inspired by authentic Cuban dance culture. We
  focus on proper technique\, coordination\, flow\, and natural body expres
 sion\, while also building confidence and strong foundations.\n\nClasses a
 re structured with:\n\n• Warm-up and body movement\n\n• Footwork and r
 hythm exercises\n\n• Partnerwork technique\n\n• Short combinations and
  practical applications\n\nOur goal is to help you understand how to dance
  salsa\, not just memorize steps — developing timing\, connection\, and 
 a comfortable\, joyful way of dancing.\n\nCome dance with us\, grow your t
 echnique\, and experience the energy and flavor of Cuba in a supportive an
 d welcoming environment.\n\nBook your spot\n\nDate & Time:\n\n4week class\
 , November 5- November 26\n\nThursdays @ 7:30 PM\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood 
 Highway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor m
 arking shoe soles allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/cuban-salsa/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.facebook.com/events/1358132066205986/"}
