SUMMARY:AKI KUMAR
DESCRIPTION:DINNER & A SHOW with AKI KUMAR \nAki Kumar\, San Jose’s “King of Bollywood Blues\,” infuses Blues\, Rock n Roll and Country with the vibrant songs of his Indian heritage\, creating a unique and electrifying musical fusion. With soulful vocals\, masterful harmonica skills and an undeniable stage presence\, Kumar brings a fresh perspective to the blues scene\, captivating audiences worldwide.
