DESCRIPTION:Richard Turgeon is a San Francisco-based singer/songwriter\, m
 ulti-instrumentalist and record producer. His alternative rock sound has b
 een called "California Rock" or "New Vintage Rock\," is regularly featured
  on SiriusXM\, and has been featured in indie film soundtracks. He's curre
 ntly playing live shows in the Bay Area and beyond with his trio\, RT3.\n\
 nLast year he played drums for national act Donnie Emerson\, subject of th
 e film "Dreamin' Wild\," and Pavement co-founder Scott Kannberg recently s
 hared Rich's cover/video of Pavement's song "Date with IKEA."\n\nHis criti
 cally acclaimed solo records from the last several years have made innumer
 able “best of” lists from various press outlets\, radio stations and b
 loggers from around the world. Visit his website at www.richardturgeon.com
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse
