 open mic on the first Saturday of the month.\n\nPoetry by the Cup is not j
 ust an open mic. It is a gathering place where community members of all ag
 es\, backgrounds\, experiences and walks of life can come together\, share
  their stories and celebrate the art of spoken word in a welcoming environ
 ment.\n\nCommunity Coffee Tasting 9 a.m. to 2 p.m. Poetry by the Cup from 
 11 a.m. to 1 p.m.
