SUMMARY:Wild Things (Lakeport)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T120000
UID:261029deyj-slT9UGl5eMdf4n_Dw
DESCRIPTION:Friends of the Lake County Library presents: Conservation Amba
 ssadors' Wild Things \n\nJoin us to meet live animals from 5 different con
 tinents and hear their extraordinary personal stories!  Space is limited\,
