DESCRIPTION:Grounded in Gratitude Sound Healing & Restorative Journey Work
 shop 🍂 Melt into the heart of fall with a deeply grounding afternoon of
  sound and stillness. Settle into long-held restorative poses as Alysia an
 d Heidi bathe you in sacred sounds\, from singing bowls and chants to the 
 soulful tones of the handpan drum. Begin with a gratitude meditation\, the
 n flow into a full restorative practice designed to release physical and e
 motional blockages. Leave feeling balanced\, renewed\, and grateful to be 
 a
LOCATION:YogaSix Santa Rosa\, 368 Coddingtown Ctr\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401
