BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "http://WineCountryMarines.org", "Press Democrat": "http://WineCountryMarines.org"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "http://WineCountryMarines.org"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Wine Country Marine Corps Birthday Ball
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T220000
UID:261031gtLi8eiUZUOZiIxwsJ_k0g
DESCRIPTION:Brigadier General Andrew T. Priddy\, Commanding General of the
  1st Marine Division\, based at Camp Pendleton in Southern California\, wi
 ll be Guest of Honor at Wine Country Marines’ 2026 Marine Corps Birthday
  Ball. The November 7 event at Jacuzzi Family Vineyards will celebrate the
  Corps’ 251st birthday.\n\nSonoma Valley’s annual event began in 1985.
  A formal Marine Corps Birthday Ball is an unusual gathering for a communi
 ty as small as Sonoma\, and its setting in the heart of California Wine Co
 untry has helped it become known as a “Destination Ball\,” drawing Mar
 ines from across the country.\n\nThe local event is part of the worldwide 
 Marine Corps Birthday Ball tradition honoring the Corps’ founding on Nov
 ember 10\, 1775. Marines gather around that date each year to celebrate th
 eir shared history and service.\n\nA career infantry officer and 1995 U.S.
  Naval Academy graduate\, Priddy assumed command of the division in May 20
 26. His participation continues Sonoma Valley’s history of welcoming dis
 tinguished military guests.\n\nFounded by local Marines and their supporte
 rs\, the Sonoma Valley event brings generations together around an endurin
 g conviction: “Once a Marine. Always a Marine.” The evening reflects a
  lifelong commitment to fellow Marines and the community that welcomes the
 m.\n\nThe celebration supports Wine Country Marines’ work assisting serv
 ice members\, veterans and their families through hardship. Military famil
 ies\, veterans and friends of the Corps are invited to join the November 7
  gathering. Explore tickets and reservations at WineCountryMarines.org.
LOCATION:Jacuzzi Family Vineyards
URL:http://WineCountryMarines.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
