DESCRIPTION:Late Fall Kirtan Ecstatica: Kiranjot\, Joss Jaffe & Isaac Rain
 \n\nJoin Kiranjot\, Joss Jaffe and Isaac Rain for a joyful\, devotional ex
 perience where sacred mantra meets global rhythm.\n\nThis is non-tradition
 al Kirtan: the main language is English\, making it accessible and inclusi
 ve\, yet the music is deeply rooted in the rich tradition of Hindustani cl
 assical music\, where devotion and practice invite you to merge into divin
 e presence.\n\nSPACE IS LIMITED. Suggested Donation $30-$75. Tickets are n
 on-refundable but may be transferred to a friend
