  that one-of-a-kind treasure with a story to tell. Immerse yourself in the
  charm of a Parisian marketplace as you browse over 140 curated booths fil
 led with vintage and antique gems for your home\, garden\, and lifestyle. 
 Relax to the sounds of live cafe-style music and indulge in delicious Fren
 ch treats while you shop. Come for the treasures and stay for the music an
 d food! The second Sunday of every month. 9:00am - 3:00pm. Free admission 
 and parking.
