SUMMARY:Churros & Soft Pretzels Cooking Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T130000
UID:261031Aby50HIYQki5XCriMnKy8A
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, November 8\, 2026 11:00 am to 1:00 pm\n\nLocation\n\n
 Room 109\, Rotary Kitchen\n\nCategory\n\nBilingual\, Culinary Arts\n\nExpe
 rience Level\n\nBeginning\n\nAges\n\n5\\+\n\nChildren must be accompanied 
 by an adult.\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$35\n\nGet ready to roll\, twist\, f
 ry\, and bake! In this fun\, hands-on class\, participants will learn how 
 to make two delicious favorites from scratch: traditional Mexican churros 
 and warm\, soft pretzels.We’ll start by preparing the dough and learning
  the proper techniques for shaping and cooking each treat. For the churros
 \, participants will learn how to pipe the dough into the classic ridged s
 hape\, fry them until golden and crispy\, and finish them with cinnamon su
 gar.For the soft pretzels\, we’ll learn how to prepare and shape the dou
 gh into the iconic pretzel twist\, give them their traditional baking-soda
  bath\, and bake them until golden brown with a soft\, chewy center.Along 
 the way\, we’ll share professional tips for working with dough\, control
 ling frying and baking temperatures\, and getting the perfect texture ever
 y time.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/churros-soft-pretzels/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
