UID:2610136JiyAD5qKEWIr8-V0LUNdA
DESCRIPTION:Local roots\, soaring music. Symphony Tierra brings together a
 n innovative combination of student musicians\, community players\, and pr
 ofessional artists for an afternoon of orchestral music that celebrates bo
 th classical traditions and contemporary voices. This project-based ensemb
 le\, founded by Dr. Christina Howell and conducted by Samantha Burgess\, c
 reates musical experiences that connect our community while providing ment
 orship opportunities for emerging musicians alongside seasoned performers.
  This concert made possible by the generosity of our friends at Festival N
 apa Valley.
