SUMMARY:Research Remix: Find Research Cite It Right with NoodleTools @ 4pm
 \, Nov 9th
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T170000
