 rk Hummel started playing harmonica in 1970 and is considered one of the p
 remier blues harmonica players of his generation. Thanks to over thirty re
 cordings since 1985\, including the  Grammy nominated 2013 release Blind P
 ig recording Remembering Little Walter \\(part of the Blues Harmonica Blow
 out CD series\\).  Mark Hummel's Blues Harmonica Blowout™ started in 199
 1 and have featured every major legend \\(Mayall\, Musselwhite\, Cotton\, 
 etc.\\) on blues harp as well as almost every player of note on the instru
 ment - a who's who of players. Doors open 5 pm. BUY IN ADVANCE AND SAVE! T
