SUMMARY:Disability Support Hour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261110T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261110T140000
DTSTAMP:20261027T133409Z
UID:20261103T210000Z-24174@calendar.santarosa.edu__20261110
ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,500,500/752_disability_support_hour_500_x_500_px.rev
 .1793133160.png
CATEGORIES:Department Events
DESCRIPTION:This is a weekly meetup for disabled people and allies to come
  together and find support and community\, ask questions\, or just talk th
 rough whatever they may be going through!  Sometimes there is a topic or g
 uest speaker\, or we talk about whatever we feel like bringing up that wee
 k!  We also have one of our DCC therapy dogs\, Casper\, with us too!  We m
 eet every Tuesday from 1:00pm to 2:00pm in the Disability Cultural Center 
 on the 3rd-floor landing of the SRJC Bertolini Student Center. Come and ch
 eck it out!For more information\, visit SRJC's DCC website. (https://drd.s
 antarosa.edu/dcc)
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027T203409Z
LOCATION:Disability Cultural Center - 3rd Floor Landing\, Bertolini Studen
 t Center - Santa Rosa Campus
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/24174-disability-support-hour
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This is a weekly meetup for disabled peo
 ple and allies to come together and find support and community\, ask quest
 ions\, or just talk through whatever they may be going through!</p><p>  So
 metimes there is a topic or guest speaker\, or we talk about whatever we f
 eel like bringing up that week!</p><p>  We also have one of our DCC therap
 y dogs\, Casper\, with us too!</p><p>  We meet every Tuesday from 1:00pm t
 o 2:00pm in the Disability Cultural Center on the 3rd-floor landing of the
  SRJC Bertolini Student Center. Come and check it out!</p><p><a href="http
 s://drd.santarosa.edu/dcc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more informa
 tion\, visit SRJC's DCC website.</a></p>
