UID:261018E3IhBS7a5k2x0Ogwwq-SUA
DESCRIPTION:Kick off the holiday season with a festive evening of shopping
 \, creativity\, and community!\n\nThursday\, November 12\, 5:00 pm – 7:0
 0 pm\n\nJoin Made Local Marketplace and MarinArts for a special holiday sh
 opping celebration featuring unique\, handcrafted gifts and original artwo
 rk by talented Marin artists and makers.\n\nSkip the ordinary gifts this y
 ear and discover something truly special! From handmade jewelry to creativ
 e treasures and one-of-a-kind finds\, there’s something for everyone on 
 your holiday shopping list.\n\nCelebrate the Season & Shop Local!\n\nDisco
 ver original artwork and handcrafted holiday gifts.\n\nFind meaningful\, o
 ne-of-a-kind presents for friends and family.\n\nSupport local artists\, m
 akers\, and small businesses.\n\nEnjoy festive sips\, sweet treats\, and h
 oliday cheer.\n\nMeet the makers and hear the stories behind their creatio
 ns.\n\nConnect with friends and neighbors in a fun\, festive atmosphere.\n
 \nMake your holiday shopping more meaningful this year! Every purchase hel
 ps support Marin’s vibrant creative community while giving a gift that
 ’s truly unique.\n\nPresented by Made Local Marketplace\n\nSponsored by 
 MarinArts\n\nShop Local. Support Marin Artists. Spread Holiday Cheer!\n\nW
 e look forward to celebrating the start of the holiday shopping season wit
 h you!
LOCATION:Made Local Marketplace Marin
URL:https://www.madelocalmarketplace.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
