DESCRIPTION:Healthcare Forum 2026 &amp\; Resource Fair\n\nTickets Are On S
 ale Now!\n\nLast November\, almost 300 people showed up for "What's Changi
 ng in Healthcare and What To Do Next\," our Healthcare Forum &amp\; Resour
 ce Fair. The atmosphere was unbelievable.\n\nRegional experts\, healthcare
  providers\, and community leaders came together to cut through the noise 
 and connect Sonoma County families with real healthcare resources.\n\nThat
  same energy is coming back.\n\nThe same design team behind last year's fo
 rum is already curating this year's program. If last year was any sign\, y
