DESCRIPTION:Appellation Healdsburg's artist-in-residence Linda Pouliot lea
 ds a hands-on collage workshop built around painted papers. Participants l
 earn to capture a scene quickly by reducing it to its essential shapes\, a
 nd to notice where color\, shape and form meet. Linda shares the methods b
 ehind her own interiors and landscapes\, plus composition tips that carry 
 over to any medium. No experience necessary.
