DESCRIPTION:Join us for our monthly literary open mic night! Bring an orig
 inal story to share or come and listen to stories told by your community m
 embers.\nStorytelling\nProse\nRecitations\nall told in 7 minutes max\nPlea
 se join us to share your original work. We will randomly select 7 (willing
 ) audience members to read or recite their work. We want YOU!\n$10/$5 for 
 OCA members. Pay @ door. Beer/wine/refreshments available.
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts\, 3850 Doris Murphy Court\, Occide
 ntal
