 with soul\, R&B\, reggae\, old school funk and Latin rock.  They will take
  you from the sixties to today with an effortless passion that might just 
 touch your soul. “Come join the family\, we are waiting for you!” Food
 : TBD Misc: Gate opens at noon. Minors welcome\, kids 12 and under are fre
