DESCRIPTION:Boston-born electro-pop group Cougar Bait has established them
 selves as one of region's premier dance bands. The three multi-instrumenta
 lists have gained recognition for both their high energy live performances
  and their unique brand of dance music\, drawing influences from house mus
 ic\, disco\, and hip hop. With their ever evolving live show and expanding
  following\, Cougar Bait's music has become a highly demanded dance floor 
 powerhouse that audiences can not seem to get enough of\, earning them the
  title "Best Electronic Act" at The Worcester Music Awards in both 2014 & 
 2015\, and "Best Live Act" in 2016. "2016's Best Live Act" Listen and stre
 am at: www.CougarBaitMusic.com
