DTSTART:20261115T000000
DTEND:20261115T000000
UID:488558da32a6cd583b1ab5995fb73edd@jacklondonpark.com
DESCRIPTION:Step into the world of Charmian Kittredge London with author M
 arlo Faulkner as she presents her book\,The Second Mrs. London. Set in San
  Francisco at the turn of the 20th century\, the novel tells the story of 
 Charmian\, a bold and ambitious woman whose life is forever changed when s
 he meets young writer Jack London. From a broken picnic date to a devoted 
 partnership as friend\, confidante\, editor\, and companion. Their story i
 s one of passion\, resilience\, and determination. Marlo Faulkner will sha
 re
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park\, 2400 London Ranch Road\, Glen E
 llen\, CA 95442
URL:https://jacklondonpark.com/events/the-second-mrs-london-2026
X-SOURCE:Jack London State Historic Park, North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
