  on your holiday shopping at our Annual Holiday Craft Fair\, featuring num
 erous local vendors with wonderful\, unique creations!\n\n🎅 Santa’s C
 orner — Browse gently used items and beautiful Christmas decorations.\n\
 n🍴 Lunch & Sweets — Delicious treats and refreshments will be availab
 le for purchase.\n\n🫔 Homemade Tamales — Our partner church will be s
 elling their delicious homemade tamales!\n\nCome shop local\, discover one
 -of-a-kind gifts\, enjoy some tasty treats\, and get into the holiday spir
 it. 🎁❤️\n\nStop by and check out all the wonderful creations for sa
 le! We look forward to seeing you there!
