 y Craft Fair.  This festive community event brings together local artisan
 s\, families\, and supporters for a weekend of handcrafted goods\, seasona
 l cheer\, and meaningful fundraising.  This year\, we are raising funds t
 o support the Sonoma Valley High Schools 2027 Grad Night\, and part of our
  efforts include raffling off a variety of artisan gifts\, donated bottles
  of wine\, a wine tasting and some donated gift cards from local restauran
 ts.  We will also have our annual Bake Sale.
