 4fa3769ae5/6ad81ca162b7c5607c4600b6/scaled_896.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Instructor: Ryan Martin Date: Monday\, November 16th
  Time: 12:30PM-2PM Location: Santa Rosa Store Free! Class 3 of 3: Lionfis
 h — This is number three in a...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
  USA
CREATED:20261021T020141Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T052720Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261024T001129Z
