 rough whatever they may be going through!  Sometimes there is a topic or g
 uest speaker\, or we talk about whatever we feel like bringing up that wee
 k!  We also have one of our DCC therapy dogs\, Casper\, with us too!  We m
 eet every Tuesday from 1:00pm to 2:00pm in the Disability Cultural Center 
 on the 3rd-floor landing of the SRJC Bertolini Student Center. Come and ch
 eck it out!For more information\, visit SRJC's DCC website. (https://drd.s
 antarosa.edu/dcc)
