BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.cellarpass.com/events/sonoma-county-vintners-pour-explore-rhone-varietals-12459", "Press Democrat": "https://www.cellarpass.com/events/sonoma-county-vintners-pour-explore-rhone-varietals-12459"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.cellarpass.com/events/sonoma-county-vintners-pour-explore-rhone-varietals-12459"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Sonoma County Vintners Pour + Explore: Rhône Varietals
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T193000
UID:261024M8l3IFxMp0eCQyXc3qtbTA
DESCRIPTION:From rich\, expressive reds to bright\, aromatic whites\, Sono
 ma County’s Rhône varietals offer a world of flavor and character waiti
 ng to be discovered.\n\nJoin us for **Pour + Explore: Rhône Varietals** h
 osted at Longboard Vineyards (5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg) on Thursday Nov
 ember 19th\, an evening celebrating the diversity\, versatility and distin
 ctive expressions of these beloved grape varieties.\n\n*Participating wine
 ries include Adobe Road Winery\, Anaba Wines\, Bricoleur Vineyards\, Cline
  Family Cellars\, Dutcher Crossing\, Kendric Vineyards\, Lasseter Family W
 ines\, Limerick Lane Cellars\, Longboard Vineyards\, Martinelli Winery\, M
 uscardinni Cellars\, Peay Vineyards\, Pride Mountain Vineyards\, Ram’s G
 ate\, Ridge +MORE!*\n\n***Food available for purchase at event!*** SoCo Pa
 ella brings over 15 years of Spanish cooking experience to Pour & Explore 
 as the event’s exclusive food vendor. Created to complement the host win
 ery’s Rhône wines\, the signature paella features peppery chicken\, ros
 emary-infused pork\, and smoky sausage\, all cooked in fragrant saffron ch
 icken broth with roasted root vegetables.
LOCATION:Longboard Vineyards
URL:https://www.cellarpass.com/events/sonoma-county-vintners-pour-explore-
 rhone-varietals-12459
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Belly Dancing with Raja - Thursdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T183000
UID:260817PmgIJZtPkEuAJJcwJaVnng
DESCRIPTION:DATE AND TIME: Thursdays\, 5:30 PM\n\nUnlock your inner streng
 th and find your flow. Belly dancing with Raja is an innovative fusion cl
 ass that blends the rhythmic artistry of belly dance with the high-energ
 y benefits of aerobics. Designed to be both a cardiovascular challenge an
 d a deep toning session\, this class focuses on the “powerhouse” of th
 e body—your core.\n\nBy layering fluid\, isolative movements over an ath
 letic aerobic base\, you will challenge your muscles in ways traditional g
 ym workouts can’t reach.\n\nWhat to Expect in Belly Dancing Class\n\n•
  Core-Centric Power: Use undulations and shimmies to engage deep abdomina
 l muscles for a tighter\, stronger midsection.\n\n• Functional Stability
 : Improve your balance and posture through controlled\, hip-driven moveme
 nts and low-impact aerobic footwork.\n\n• Total Body Toning: Build lean
  muscle in your legs\, glutes\, and arms while maintaining a constant\, he
 art-pumping pace.\n\n• Mind-Body Connection: Enhance your coordination 
 and body awareness through rhythmic\, expressive choreography.\n\n“Wheth
 er you’re looking to define your waistline or simply want a workout that
  feels like a celebration\, this class offers the perfect balance of sweat
  and grace.”\n\nDifficulty Level: All levels welcome! No prior dance ex
 perience is required—just bring your energy and a willingness to move.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
