BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sebastopol Center for the Arts": "https://www.sebarts.org/classes-lectures/stone-wrapping"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sebarts
SUMMARY:Stone Wrapping — Sebastopol Center For the Arts\, California
DTSTART:20261121T000000
DTEND:20261122T000000
UID:4e3e180032a2b163e21a653fb0edbe8d@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Stone Wrapping\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          $145.0
 0\n        \n      \n    \n  \n\nStone Wrapping Saturday\, November 21st 1
 0:00am-3:00pm $125.00 + $20.00 Materials fee In this class\, students will
  be creating decorative stones\, utilizing wrapping techniques that can be
  applied outside of this class. Students will learn 3 basic knots with tim
 e allotted between each lesson for students to experiment creating new sto
 nes with the new knot. This approach allows everyone’s imagination to ru
 n wild\, fostering creativity and allowing time for new ideas. All materia
 ls provided. Students often make 6-8 stones per class. There will be discu
 ssion breaks\, and a lunch break throughout the class. Please bring water 
 and a paper bag lunch. About the Teacher: Carrie Botto is a self taught mu
 lti-medium weaver. She started weaving with beads over 40 years ago and co
 ntinues to add skills and techniques to her “tool box”. Carrie travels
  all over the country now teaching several different classes\, and has tau
 ght at Mendocino Art Center\, New Mexico Bead Trader\, Moab Art Center\, a
 nd Fiber on 4th in New Mexico. Follow Carrie on Instagram @beanstreetsudio
 ! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n      
     \n            \n              \n                Add to cart
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 
 95472
URL:https://www.sebarts.org/classes-lectures/stone-wrapping
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Center for the Arts
END:VEVENT
