UID:260918nUFYDvx-YEKj0kpi7WzMhg
DESCRIPTION:Join Jack London Park Partners and Sonoma Ecology Center staff
  for the last in a series of intermediate hikes\, guided in Spanish\, betw
 een Jack London State Historic Park and Sugarloaf Ridge State Park. Each h
 ike is a round trip\, returning to the starting point\, and will increase 
 in length or difficulty. Not appropriate for children under 12 years old.\
 n\nSat.  Nov. 21 – "The Big Loop" at Sugarloaf. 7.37 miles\, 1\,739 ft 
 elevation \\(meet at Sugarloaf Ridge State Park\\).
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://sec.regfox.com/reto2026
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
