SUMMARY:Holiday Open House + Marketplace
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T150000
UID:261007s0Es-UzrrkCEE4IilzwwYQ
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season at Grand Cru’s 2026 Holiday Open House 
 \\+ Marketplace! Join us Saturday\, November 21st for a festive afternoon 
 of wine\, shopping\, local food\, and community as we welcome our member w
 ineries\, local makers\, artisans\, and food vendors for a special holiday
  celebration.\n\nTaste your way through an exciting lineup of Grand Cru wi
 neries\, shop unique gifts from local makers and artisans\, enjoy deliciou
 s food and charcuterie\, and get a head start on your holiday shopping —
  all while supporting the incredible small businesses in our community.\n\
 nParticipating Wineries: Bienvenue | Boars’ View | Bruliam | Bucher | Co
 pper Six | Fat Dragon | DuMOL | Jeff Cohn | Moret Brealynn | Parea | Strin
 ger \\+ more to be announced!\n\nHoliday Marketplace: Beeyond Boutique Can
 dles | Fiorella Designs | Hei Ma Chili Crisp | House of Azurite | Kiss the
  Flower Honey Co. | Maya Bauman Designs | MG Pottery | Quack Quack Pop | S
 nug Cashmere | Sonoma Sauces | Sura Botanicals | Unparalleled Designs\n\nF
 ood & Charcuterie: Bayou on the Bay | Thanks for the Invite | Three’s a 
 Platter - Charcuterie\n\nYour ticket includes: Admission and wine tastings
  from participating wineries. Food\, additional wine purchases\, and marke
 tplace offerings will be available for purchase separately.\n\nSaturday\, 
 November 21\, 2026 | 11 AM–3 PM Grand Cru Custom Crush | 1200 American W
 ay\, Windsor\, CA\n\nTaste. Shop. Eat. Discover. Celebrate.\n\nCome stock 
 up on wine for the holidays\, find unique gifts\, enjoy great local food\,
  and spend the afternoon supporting the wineries\, makers\, artisans\, and
  small businesses that make our community so special.
LOCATION:Grand Cru Custom Crush
URL:https://www.grandcrucustomcrush.com/upcoming-events/open-house-novembe
 r-21
X-SOURCE:Creative Sonoma, North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
