DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable evening with the talented Lucy Ka
 plansky at the charming Hopmonk Tavern - Sebastopol! Nestled in the heart 
 of Sebastopol\, California\, this intimate venue is known for its warm atm
 osphere and exceptional acoustics\, making it the perfect backdrop for Luc
 y's soulful melodies and heartfelt storytelling. Whether you're a long-tim
 e fan or new to her music\, you're in for a treat as she weaves together h
 er signature blend of country and folk. Don't miss your chance to experien
 ce Lucy Kaplansky - Sebastopol live! Gather your friends and immerse yours
 elf in an enchanting night filled with beautiful tunes and captivating per
 formances. Grab your tickets now and get ready to create some wonderful me
 mories at Hopmonk Tavern!
