X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This is a weekly meetup for disabled peo
 ple and allies to come together and find support and community\, ask quest
 ions\, or just talk through whatever they may be going through!</p><p>  So
 metimes there is a topic or guest speaker\, or we talk about whatever we f
 eel like bringing up that week!</p><p>  We also have one of our DCC therap
 y dogs\, Casper\, with us too!</p><p>  We meet every Tuesday from 1:00pm t
 o 2:00pm in the Disability Cultural Center on the 3rd-floor landing of the
  SRJC Bertolini Student Center. Come and check it out!</p><p><a href="http
 s://drd.santarosa.edu/dcc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more informa
 tion\, visit SRJC's DCC website.</a></p>
