 nner Light Crystals is women-owned and operated\, proudly local\, inclusiv
 e\, and welcoming to all.\n\nWednesdays • 11 AM–6 PM\n\nInner Light Cr
 ystals\n\n4936 Sonoma Hwy\n\nSanta Rosa\, CA
LOCATION:Inner Light Crystals
