BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/thanksgiving-at-john-ash-co/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Thanksgiving at John Ash & Co.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T180000
UID:261019slgF6MEZkEaUd5eJWzhYPQ
DESCRIPTION:Thanksgiving at John Ash features a four-course holiday menu c
 elebrating seasonal flavors. The meal begins with farm greens tossed with 
 shaved fennel\, winter citrus\, pomegranate\, crispy wild rice and toasted
  pepitas\, followed by a choice of French onion soup topped with melted Gr
 uyère or roasted squash with spiced crème fraiche and crisp apple salad.
  For the main course\, guests can choose roasted turkey breast with guajil
 lo and orange\, stuffing bread pudding\, green beans\, mushroom cream\, cr
 anberry and rosemary jus\; miso black cod with celery root purée\, roaste
 d brassicas\, turnip and brown butter-Meyer lemon-parsley oil\; or squash 
 dirty rice with mushrooms\, country captain sauce\, fried sage\, scallions
  and toasted benne. The meal concludes with a seasonal "Apple Pie" dessert
  featuring warm spiced apples\, crumble\, whipped cream\, salted caramel a
 nd sorrel.
LOCATION:John Ash & Co.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/thanksgiving-at-john-ash-co/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/thanksgiving-at-sante/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Thanksgiving at Santé
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T190000
UID:261019kAhQS7Rf-k2JJMereOG4Iw
DESCRIPTION:Santé Thanksgiving Buffet at Fairmont Sonoma offers a festive
  holiday feast featuring seasonal favorites\, an impressive seafood tower\
 , and a traditional carving station with Diestel turkey and oven-roasted p
 rime New York strip. Guests can finish their meal with an indulgent desser
 t buffet filled with sweet treats. Parties of seven or more are asked to c
 ontact the Private Dining team by email. Reservations require prepayment\,
  and cancellations must be made by November 21. Prices exclude 9.25% sales
  tax and a 20% service charge.
LOCATION:Santé Restaurant
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/thanksgiving-at-sante/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
