 et featuring seasonal favorites in the heart of wine country. Guests can e
 njoy fresh\, vibrant salads\, perfectly roasted meats and decadent dessert
 s in a welcoming setting designed for gathering with loved ones. Blending 
 traditional holiday flavors with modern touches\, this festive meal is a d
 elicious way to celebrate Thanksgiving together.
LOCATION:Spoonbar
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/celebrate-thanksgiving-at-spoonbar/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
