SUMMARY:Point Reyes Open Studios -- Thanksgiving Weekend
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T170000
UID:261022WQegw7T_l024j3SlH5pFWA
DESCRIPTION:Art lovers from around the Bay Area are invited to tour artist
 s' studios in Point Reyes Station and Inverness during Point Reyes Open St
 udios this Thanksgiving weekend\, when 16 artists will open their studios 
 to the public. \n\nDon't miss West Marin's finest painters\, sculptors\, 
 photographers\, potters\, print-makers\, jewelry-makers\, woodworker\, and
  mixed-media artists.  Visitors will be able to meet the artists\, see ne
 w original work\, purchase art\, and explore the places where the art is c
 reated.\n\nMap\, studio addresses and details can be found online at point
 reyesart.com and in our print brochures available at many area businesses.
LOCATION:Point Reyes/Inverness
URL:https://pointreyesart.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
