DESCRIPTION:Winter Lights Tree Lighting Celebration returns to Downtown Sa
 nta Rosa for a beloved holiday tradition presented by the Santa Rosa Metro
  Chamber. Held at Courthouse Square\, this free community event kicks off 
 the holiday season with live entertainment\, festive food and drinks\, fam
 ily-friendly activities\, photos with Santa and the official lighting of t
 he city's holiday tree. With more than 40 years of bringing the community 
 together\, Winter Lights offers a magical way for families and friends to 
 celebrate the start of the season. Additional details about this year's ce
 lebration will be announced soon.
