DESCRIPTION:**Saturday\, November 28\, 2026 12 – 4 p.m. · Open House Fo
 rmat  21 & Older Only · No Children or Pets Allowed**\n\nKick off the mo
 st wonderful time of the year with a decades-long Dry Creek Vineyard tradi
 tion: our annual Holiday Celebration and Marketplace. Sample a selection o
 f limited-release wines perfect for giving and gathering\, while you enjoy
  holiday classics sung by carolers and savor seasonal bites. Peruse charmi
 ng gifts from local vendors and artisans in our holiday market as we celeb
 rate Small Business Saturday\, a spectacular time to show support for shop
  owners and creatives in our community.\n\nAdmission includes: A walk-arou
 nd tasting of our favorite wines for the holidays | Access to our Holiday 
 Marketplace featuring local artisans\, carolers and Santa | Seasonal small
  bites \n\nVendors: Carrie Shere Ceramics | Foolish Pride and Leather | F
 ortuna Jewelry Co. | Hana Moriah Jewelry | Paper and Parcel | Rainy Day Ch
 ocolate | Elleteux | Letter This Letter That | Scarlet Moon Bath & Body\n\
 n**Help Us Support Healdsburg Food Pantry**\n\nWe’re hosting a canned fo
 od drive to support the Healdsburg Food Pantry during the event! For each
  can of food you bring\, you’ll receive a ticket for our drawing featuri
 ng special prizes. Thank you for helping us spread holiday cheer in our co
 mmunity.
