UID:261012opcl1bY_YEe8utVgdEVF5g
DESCRIPTION:with Erin Selover\n\nJoin us for a day of Insight Meditation p
 ractice. This daylong will be held in noble silence with alternating sitti
 ng and walking meditation as well as teachings that support the cultivatio
 n of equanimity—the capacity to stand in the center of things with a cal
 m\, wise\, and clear heart. Our time together is designed both for those n
 ewer to practice who are curious about retreat\, as well as more experienc
 ed practitioners wanting to reconnect. All are welcome!
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
