 hrowing skills through more complex demos\, and nuanced approaches to tech
 nical throwing. In this 8 week course\, students will dive deep into devel
 oping their own unique voice as they build a technical toolset for the ind
 ependent maker. In addition to throwing\, surface decoration techniques wi
 ll be explored as well as the opportunity to experiment with different cla
 y bodies.With your 8 week class registration\, students receive the opport
 unity to purchase a studio pass for ½ off during the duration of their cl
