 our drawings and get to the fun part of creating!\n\nAnn will introduce y
 ou to a variety of drawing materials and teach you how to use them. You c
 an also expect to explore a variety of different papers\, and materials t
 hat will aid in transferring your sketch to a more refined\, complete pie
