  disciplines\, higher education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle bet
 ween opposing camps\, but of intentional design.</p><p>  Generative system
 s offer novel capabilities for research\, creation\, and learning\, yet th
 eir ultimate value depends entirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.</p>
 <p><strong>Zack Darling</strong> is an award-winning brand builder with de
 cades of experience in strategy\, development\, experiential design\, and 
 fabrication.</p><p><a href="https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026" target
 ="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks
  website.</a></p>
