 sen topic within ceramics\, we eat\, converse\, ask questions\, and unapol
 ogetically explore the world of clay together.Everyone is welcome to share
  in our potluck style gatherings\, we encourage folks to bring a drink or 
 snack to share. Check out our next round of Makers Meetings below.Schedule
