UID:4997fb3b0982bc230247e65027209dd7@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County’s Velvet Thorn of Epineux Productions\, and Mi
 mic Velour\, creator of the sold out LoTR Burlesque\, are banding together
  to bring you a night of luxurious burlesque to bring a little glamour int
 o your new year. Who couldn’t use a little sparkle and dazzle to bring i
