 n a first come first serve basis.  Can't make it? Leftover produce and oth
 er items are moved to the Welcome &amp\; Connect Center Food Pantry after 
 each event and will stay there through the end of the week.  &#160\;  Cont
 act information:Petaluma Welcome &amp\; Connect Center (https://petaluma.s
 antarosa.edu/welcome)  (petalumawelcome@santarosa.edu)  &#160\;  SRJC Peta
