BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_c_rilc5rtgatnr4oln08fo9p5k30
SUMMARY:Sips and Stars
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270109T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270109T193000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052720Z
UID:2272e910jll98ehnbj40ol519g@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270109T170000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260903T160921Z
DESCRIPTION:Sips and Stars ~ an evening of fine wine and cosmic wonder.\n\
 nJoin us for a magical night under the stars at the Robert Ferguson Observ
 atory! Our Sips & Stars event blends the beauty of the night sky with the 
 elegance of Sonoma County wine. Enjoy a curated tasting experience hosted 
 by a local winery\, while taking in breathtaking views of the cosmos throu
 gh our powerful telescopes.\n\nAs twilight falls\, relax with a glass of w
 ine in hand and listen to engaging astronomy talks from our knowledgeable 
 docents. Once darkness settles\, step up to the observatory’s telescopes
  for guided viewing of planets\, star clusters\, and distant galaxies.\n\n
 Whether you’re a wine lover\, stargazer\, or simply looking for a unique
  evening out in Sonoma Valley\, Sips & Stars promises an unforgettable exp
 erience where earthly pleasures meet celestial beauty.\n\nGuests must be 2
 1 or older to attend and each registration includes two drink tickets. Pro
 ceeds support the Robert Ferguson Observatory’s public education program
 s.\n\nSpace is limited - register at rfo.simpletix.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20260903T161829Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Robert Ferguson Observatory
END:VEVENT
