SUMMARY:Goddess Circle - Mother Earth Temple
DESCRIPTION:The Unstruck Drum Center for Shamanism and Healing\n**Goddess 
 Circle -Mother Earth Temple**\nREGISTER HERE: https://www.eventbrite.com/e
 /2003681617656?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\n**Goddess Circle meets monthly and is 
 for women\, and for those who identify as a woman.**\nCome join us for an 
 evening to remember all the love and support available thru true connectio
 n to Mother Earth. She is the Divine Mother love that supports all life on
  this planet. Every indigenous culture began with a love and reverence for
  Her\, the origin of all life.\n\nBe witnessed in sisterhood in a sacred s
 pace at 510 Lewis Rd\, Santa Rosa located inside Revolution Yoga.\n\nWe we
 ar EARTH COLORS to honor all that is below us. Adorn yourself to your own 
 comfort level to express your own Goddess self.\nREGISTER HERE: https://ww
 w.eventbrite.com/e/2003681617656?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\nBring your journal\,
  altar item\, and water bottle or mug for tea. Don't miss out on this spec
 ial gathering!
