SUMMARY: Take the art of Still Life to new places
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Sandra Novia\n\nDates: Thursdays\, Ongoing. This 
 is an ongoing 6-class series. You can start your series anytime.\n\nTime:
  11:30am - 1:30pm.\n\nLocation : Santa Rosa Store\n\nFee: $310 for 6 clas
 ses. Please check with the instructor for details.\n\n\nThis class is for
  art explorers of all levels!\n\nCreating a still life is about waking up
  your observational skills. Moving through different mediums\, we will em
 bark on a journey together\, exploring how to apply many art forms and te
 chniques to express what you see in life.\n\nIn this six week course\, ea
 ch class will explore a different art medium. We will draw and paint with
